@base = http://127.0.0.1:3000
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_DO_LOGIN
@characterId = 1
@spellId = 2

### Health
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Cadastro (troque nome/email/senha)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Jogador","email":"jogador@example.com","password":"Troque-esta-senha-123"}

### Login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"jogador@example.com","password":"Troque-esta-senha-123"}

### Classes acessíveis
GET {{base}}/api/classes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Escolas
GET {{base}}/api/schools
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crie um personagem com classId retornado pelas classes
POST {{base}}/api/characters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Meu personagem","classId":2,"level":1}

### Catálogo completo
GET {{base}}/api/spells?limit=500
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Busca e indicação de preparação
GET {{base}}/api/spells?name=moribundos&characterId={{characterId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dados do card
GET {{base}}/api/spells/{{spellId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Preparar
PUT {{base}}/api/characters/{{characterId}}/prepared-spells/{{spellId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Preparadas
GET {{base}}/api/characters/{{characterId}}/prepared-spells
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Despreparar
DELETE {{base}}/api/characters/{{characterId}}/prepared-spells/{{spellId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Nova magia homebrew (consulte os IDs)
POST {{base}}/api/spells
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Chama Azul","level":1,"schoolId":6,"components":"V, S","castingTime":"Ação","range":"18 metros","duration":"Instantânea","description":"Descrição completa, sem reescrita.","classIds":[2]}

### Sair
POST {{base}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
